      "documentId": "document:houhanshu-f030da68d13b75a1",
      "query": "楊素",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 5733,
      "excerpt": "封爵之制，非勤不定。帝益以為能，尚書眾事，皆令總錄之。\n\n司徒侯霸薦前梁令閻楊。楊素有譏議，帝常嫌之，既見霸奏，疑其有奸，大怒，賜霸璽書曰：『崇山、幽都何可偶，黃鉞一下無處所。欲以身試法邪？將殺身以成仁邪？』使勤奉策至司徒府。勤還，陳霸本意，申",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "後漢書/卷26",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%BE%8C%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B726",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2616538",
      "textSha256": "ea916d28239ac5aee4a2800a36d5c8cd539255b90710f4be484977b6b731b0ab",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/houhanshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:houhanshu-1eeafbbe2d37d056",
      "query": "楊素",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 12663,
      "excerpt": "文「闅」，今作「閿」，流俗誤也。〕\n\n四年，張楊為其將楊醜所殺。〔《魏志》曰：「楊素與呂布善。曹公之圍布，楊欲救之不能，乃出兵東巿，遙為之埶。其將楊醜殺楊以應曹公。」〕以董承為車騎將軍，開府。\n\n自都許之後，權歸曹氏，天子緫己，百官備員而已。帝",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "後漢書/卷72",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%BE%8C%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B772",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2676948",
      "textSha256": "fcd1356d993c08f8bdd65af24bd7855b38b3f4674318f8cec15e9efe102969bc",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/houhanshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-4067a63fbdb4be90",
      "query": "楊素",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 8674,
      "excerpt": "大司馬。〔《英雄記》曰：楊性仁和，無威刑。下人謀反，發覺，對之涕泣，輒原不問。〕楊素與呂布善。太祖之圍布，楊欲救之，不能。乃出兵東市，遙為之勢。其將楊醜，殺楊以應太祖。楊將眭固殺醜，將其眾，欲北合袁紹。太祖遣史渙邀擊，破之於犬城，斬固，盡收其眾",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷08",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B708",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2086403",
