      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-1598e5fe965db8d8",
      "query": "楊素",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 7158,
      "excerpt": "城，前刺史晉熙王叔文還至巴州，與巴州刺史畢寶、荊州刺史陳紀並降。隋行軍元帥清河公楊素兵下荊門，別遣其將龐暉將兵略地，南至湘州，城內將士，莫有固志，克日請降。叔慎乃置酒會文武僚吏，酒酣，叔慎歎曰「君臣之義，盡於此乎！」長史謝基伏而流涕，湘州助防遂",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷28",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B728",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2581394",
      "textSha256": "abfbd93ee92b04d03d920dc0ee17240f71d77557f662681df94b76ae7e59c901",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:chenshu-3e6aa242cac8eb9d",
      "query": "楊素",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 1757,
      "excerpt": "待從典。俄屬金陵淪沒，隨例遷關右。仕隋為給事郎，兼東宮學士。又除著作佐郎。右僕射楊素奏從典續司馬遷史記迄于隋，其書未就。值隋末喪亂，寓居南陽郡，以疾卒，時年五十七。\n\n顧野王\n\n　　顧野王字希馮，吳郡吳人也。祖子喬，梁東中郎武陵王府參軍事。父烜",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "陳書/卷30",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%99%B3%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B730",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511158",
      "textSha256": "9cd7559e38d913cb5c7aad455b53077c0a5ace68034dda22668af659876b86e0",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/chenshu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:zhoushu-ec46aaacaef9d769",
      "query": "楊素",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 885,
      "excerpt": "、越、代、滕五王入朝不趨，劍履上殿。滎州刺史、邵國公宇文冑舉兵，遣大將軍、清河公楊素討之。青州總管尉遲勤舉兵。丁未，隨公楊堅為都督內外諸軍事。己酉，䢵州總管司馬消難舉兵，以柱國、楊國公王誼為行軍元帥，率軍討之。壬子，歲星與太白合於張，有流星大如",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "周書/卷08",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B708",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2589012",
      "textSha256": "1c375c183f361399b45081b1a19ff719025c5118ea2aa7e63caf2f3bc90d6ddc",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/zhoushu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:zhoushu-f643cb9b0d58a9f8",
      "query": "楊素",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 658,
      "excerpt": "大將軍，出為原州刺史，轉滎州刺史。大象末，隋文帝輔政，冑舉州兵應尉遲迥，與清河公楊素戰，敗，遂走，追獲於石濟，遂斬之。國除。\n\n冑子 乾仁\n\n〔（冑子）〕〔會字〕乾仁，〔〔（冑子）〕〔會字〕乾仁　北史卷五七周宗室傳稱「會字乾仁」。張森楷云：「案",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "周書/卷10",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B710",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2432561",
      "textSha256": "ae13dfa1e32af14a4bba11f41231cec4cc8f82eb6d2048008087a9e4b43a7480",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/zhoushu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:zhoushu-153c6a40fddb14aa",
      "query": "楊素",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 7971,
      "excerpt": "氏諸傳多據子孫家狀，周書分列數卷，致有此誤，今不改。〕博涉羣書，辭彩雅贍。與弘農楊素為莫逆之交。解巾中外府記室參軍。建德初，除內史上士，歷小宮尹、御正上士。〔御正上士　「御」原作「卿」。諸本和北史卷六四柳虯附從子弘傳、冊府卷六二一〔七四七五頁〕",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "周書/卷22",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B722",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2432547",
      "textSha256": "04b59ccde13cef9b49eef88272b13667febedef30cd545e14c55e81a364c2801",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/zhoushu.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:zhoushu-d6b62ce6b83299c3",
      "query": "楊素",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 10192,
      "excerpt": "之蒼頭也，驍武絕人。士彥每從征伐，常與默陷陣。仕周，位開府。開皇末，以行軍總管從楊素征突厥，進位大將軍。又從平楊諒，授柱國。大業五年，從煬帝征吐谷渾，力戰死之。贈光祿大夫。",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "周書/卷31",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B731",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2074189",
